  "bodyHash": "7adb5dc46f8e354d",
  "content": "\n\n<p>為伺服器新增許多實用的工具指令：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>請在此處查看文件：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdocs-essentials\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/docs-essentials</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>其他指令：</p>\n<p>/kickme - 將自己踢出伺服器（以防床 bug 再次出現）</p>\n<p>/trashcan - 開啟一個物品欄，放入物品並關閉後會將其刪除</p>\n<p>/leaderboard - 尚未實作</p>\n<p>/rec - 尚未實作</p>\n<p>/hat - 將主手持有的物品放入頭盔槽位，作為你的「帽子」</p>\n<p>/nick &lt;name…&gt; - 更改聊天中的暱稱</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>作弊指令：</p>\n<p>/heal - 將玩家生命值與飽食度恢復至滿值</p>\n<p>/fly - 切換飛行模式</p>\n<p>/god - 尚未實作</p>\n<p>/invsee &lt;player&gt; - 允許查看與編輯其他玩家的物品欄</p>\n<p>/nickfor &lt;player&gt; &lt;name…&gt; - 更改其他玩家在聊天中的暱稱</p>\n<p>/mute - 禁言玩家</p>\n<p>/unmute - 解除玩家禁言</p>\n<p>/teleport_last &lt;player&gt; - 傳送至該玩家最後已知位置</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>傳送指令：</p>\n<p>/back - 傳送至上一次的位置。可重複使用</p>\n<p>/spawn - 將你傳送至重生點</p>\n<p>/rtp - 將你傳送至世界中的隨機位置，並嘗試尋找非海洋的安全降落點</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>/home [name] - 傳送至家中</p>\n<p>/sethome &lt;name&gt; - 設定家</p>\n<p>/delhome &lt;name&gt; - 刪除家</p>\n<p>/listhomes [player] - 列出所有玩家的家</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>/warp &lt;name&gt; - 傳送至傳送點</p>\n<p>/setwarp &lt;name&gt; - 設定傳送點</p>\n<p>/delwarp &lt;name&gt; - 刪除傳送點</p>\n<p>/listwarps - 列出所有傳送點</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>/tpa &lt;player&gt; - 請求傳送至該玩家</p>\n<p>/tpahere &lt;player&gt; - 請求該玩家傳送至你所在位置</p>\n<p>/tpaccept &lt;id&gt; - 接受請求（螢幕上會有按鈕可供點擊）</p>\n<p>/tpadeny &lt;id&gt; - 拒絕請求（螢幕上會有按鈕可供點擊）</p>\n<h2>支援</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>若遇到<strong>整合包</strong>相關問題，請前往此處：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-modpack</a></li>\n<li>若遇到<strong>模組</strong>相關問題，請前往此處：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-mod-issues</a></li>\n<li>有任何疑問？歡迎前往我們的 Discord：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/discord</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>保持關注</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fgithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-github.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitter-x.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fyoutube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-youtube.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitch.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252finstagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-instagram.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ffacebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-facebook.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftiktok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-tiktok.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
